      maturity: '<strong>Current maturity:</strong> a vendor-neutral model catalog, capability taxonomy, workload declarations, and routing output contracts exist. <strong>Partnership work:</strong> implement the resolver runtime, host bindings, model-version governance, and outcome evidence collection.',
      sub: 'Governed workloads declare capability demand; a deterministic resolver is specified to score canonical model profiles and break ties by cost. Runtime qualification should then incorporate measured task success, schema adherence, rework, latency, cost, and human intervention. The current catalog is configuration, not proof of model fitness, and the harness that performs routing is not yet implemented.',
